00:44:54.414 --> 00:44:55.830
PETER-MARK VERWOERD:
Well, I mean,

00:44:55.830 --> 00:44:57.746
we do have a lot of white
papers that describe

00:44:57.746 --> 00:45:01.380
how Spanner actually works.

00:45:01.380 --> 00:45:04.240
So it's theoretically possible.

00:45:04.240 --> 00:45:07.110
And, in fact, actually, I
can't remember the name,

00:45:07.110 --> 00:45:10.226
somebody has actually
created an open source-- hm?

00:45:10.226 --> 00:45:11.100
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE]

